# msg-patterns.list — this repo's tracked generic banned-pattern list (gate-sdk
# default template, gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-commit-msg). One grep -E pattern per
# line; '#' comments and blank lines ignored. Private repo/project/account terms
# live in the gitignored msg-patterns.local.list, never here. Files named
# msg-patterns* are self-exempt from check-tree-terms.

# Absolute home paths — leak the local filesystem layout into this public tree.
/(home|Users)/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+

# The Claude Code promo URL — the marketing link that ends a generated PR body.
# The Co-Authored-By trailer is a footer convention, not a leak: do not ban it.
claude\.com/claude-code

# Session-reference class — a harness-injected trailer referencing an internal
# session, before it lands in public history. The session-share URL host (public
# software's public domain, so a shape not a private term); and a trailer-shaped
# 'Key: ' lead-in whose value, one token with no space, ends in a full UUID —
# the session-id trailer shape whatever key the harness uses. The UUID half is
# trailer-anchored so it matches an injected footer, never the synthetic
# session UUIDs check-tree-terms scans in smoke/.
claude\.ai/
^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z-]*: [^ ]*[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}

# Account-identification class — cite the role, never the account. Bans a
# handle-shaped backticked token near an account noun, singular or plural, in
# either order, inside one clause. Not handle-shaped: a short all-lowercase token (a CLI name) and
# a token of punctuation alone. Scope, calibration and honest limit:
# gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-commit-msg.
(^|[^A-Za-z])(accounts?|logins?|usernames?|handles?)[^A-Za-z`.;-][^`.;]{0,6}`([a-z]*[0-9A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*|[a-z]+[_.-][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*|[_.-]+[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*|[a-z]{6,})`|`([a-z]*[0-9A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*|[a-z]+[_.-][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*|[_.-]+[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*|[a-z]{6,})`[^A-Za-z`.;][^`.;]{0,6}(accounts?|logins?|usernames?|handles?)([^A-Za-z-]|$)
